  "extraction": {
    "raw_schema": "solana-finalized-pump-event-excerpt/v1",
    "policy": "Selective canonical extracts retain transaction identity/position/status/fee, exact Pump instruction position/data, exact Program data log line, decoded fields and the digest of the complete RPC result. Unrelated accounts, balances, instructions and log lines are intentionally omitted.",
    "integer_policy": "All u16/u64/i64 values and all slots, indices, timestamps, balances, amounts and fees are decimal strings; booleans remain JSON booleans.",
    "curve_pre_policy": "TradeEvent contains post-state. Each vector's pre-state is the exact inverse event transition: BUY subtracts quote from post quote reserves and adds tokens to post token reserves; SELL adds quote to post quote reserves and subtracts tokens from post token reserves.",
    "success_policy": "Every trade excerpt has meta.err = null and was returned at finalized commitment.",
    "mode_policy": "Token program is proven twice: by the exact Pump instruction account and by finalized mint-account owner evidence. Current TOKEN_2022/CASHBACK/MAYHEM modes additionally use explicit TradeEvent fields. Legacy vectors use the historical exact-decoding IDL, legacy Token Program and a time before the explicit mode fields existed.",
    "mayhem_user_policy": "MAYHEM vectors have explicit mayhem_mode=true, non-zero 95/30 Pump fees and user 8FXJtB7P2RDcNtSAf5J8QwFPUxtqej3igiiE5XvB9Kgo, not the documented fee-exempt Mayhem agent BwWK17cbHxwWBKZkUYvzxLcNQ1YVyaFezduWbtm2de6s."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "The checked-in raw files are selective extracts, not complete RPC responses; complete-response canonical SHA-256 values allow independent re-query comparison.",
    "Mint-account owner/supply evidence was observed at the recorded later finalized context slots; the exact trade instruction independently records the token-program account at execution.",
    "Pre-curve states are exact inverse transitions derived from decoded event data, not separately fetched bonding-curve account snapshots.",
    "The two legacy vectors use different mints but the same finalized historical block and the same historical fee/mode contract."
  ],
